000010 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000020 PROGRAM-ID. STRING1.
000030 DATA DIVISION.
000040 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
000050 01  FIRST-NAME     PIC X(10) VALUE "ADA".
000060 01  LAST-NAME      PIC X(10) VALUE "LOVELACE".
000070 01  CITY           PIC X(15) VALUE "LONDON, UK".
000080 01  COMMA-SIGN     PIC X     VALUE ",".
000090 01  FULL-NAME      PIC X(25).
000100 01  ADDR           PIC X(25).
000110 01  SHORT-OUT      PIC X(8).
000120 01  PTR            PIC 99.
000130 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
000140     MOVE SPACES TO FULL-NAME
000150     STRING FIRST-NAME DELIMITED BY SPACE
000160            " "        DELIMITED BY SIZE
000170            LAST-NAME  DELIMITED BY SPACE
000180         INTO FULL-NAME
000190     END-STRING
000200     DISPLAY "FULL NAME: [" FULL-NAME "]"
000210     MOVE SPACES TO ADDR
000220     STRING "CITY=" CITY DELIMITED BY COMMA-SIGN
000230         INTO ADDR
000240     DISPLAY "UP TO THE COMMA: [" ADDR "]"
000250     MOVE ALL "." TO ADDR
000260     MOVE 4 TO PTR
000270     STRING "ABC" "DEF" DELIMITED BY SIZE
000280         INTO ADDR WITH POINTER PTR
000290     DISPLAY "AT POSITION 4: [" ADDR "]  POINTER NOW " PTR
000300     MOVE SPACES TO SHORT-OUT
000310     STRING FIRST-NAME LAST-NAME DELIMITED BY SIZE
000320         INTO SHORT-OUT
000330         ON OVERFLOW DISPLAY "OVERFLOW: [" SHORT-OUT "]"
000340         NOT ON OVERFLOW DISPLAY "IT FIT"
000350     END-STRING
000360     MOVE SPACES TO SHORT-OUT
000370     STRING FIRST-NAME DELIMITED BY SPACE
000380         INTO SHORT-OUT
000390         ON OVERFLOW DISPLAY "OVERFLOW"
000400         NOT ON OVERFLOW DISPLAY "IT FIT: [" SHORT-OUT "]"
000410     END-STRING
000420     STOP RUN.
